---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+12815550199';
---
<Layout title="Dirty Pool Filter – Spring, TX Cleaning & Replacement" description="Pool filter cleaning and media replacement in Spring, TX. Restore flow and clarity with professional service.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Dirty Filter</h1><p>Restore flow and water clarity with a clean filter.</p></div></section>
  <section class="content-section"><div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
    <p>A clogged filter reduces circulation, raises pressure, and lets fine particles remain in the water. Regular cleaning or media replacement is essential, especially after algae or heavy debris seasons.</p>
    <h2>What We Offer</h2>
    <ul><li>Cartridge cleaning or replacement</li><li>DE grid cleaning and recharging</li><li>Sand filter media replacement</li><li>Pressure and flow assessment</li><li>Advice on filter sizing for your pool</li></ul>
    <p>We can include filter care in your weekly plan or schedule a dedicated cleaning when pressure rises.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Clean My Filter</a></p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
